OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFog and low cloud clear
OL,6,Fsteadily leaving a dry day with light
OL,7,Fwinds and plenty of sunshine. Feeling
OL,8,Frather mild with temperatures slightly
OL,9,Fabove average.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry with clear skies and
OL,12,Flight winds. Some mist and fog patches
OL,13,Fforming in some prone spots by
OL,14,Fmorning. Chillier than Thursday night.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FFog and low cloud clear,
OL,17,Flingering in prone spots, but another
OL,18,Fdry day with sunny spells to follow.
OL,19,FWinds remaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
